  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let a function <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be continuous, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math><mi>F</mi></math> be defined as:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>u</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Then for the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> the point <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
