  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>By Leibnitz rule we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>''</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>''</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>''</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mo>''</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> has&nbsp;a local minimum at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>",
